129
00:08:11,500 --> 00:08:13,800
without bringing the whole system crashing down.

130
00:08:14,200 --> 00:08:16,300
Which leaves us with this final thought today:

131
00:08:16,400 --> 00:08:18,900
Take a look at the projects
