135
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,800
are you really in control of your code?

136
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:34,300
Mastering Git and GitHub
isn't just about saving your files;

137
00:08:34,500 --> 00:08:37,800
it's about engineering with absolute,
undeniable confidence.

138
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:40,800
So start exploring those internal mechanics,

139
00:08:40,800 --> 00:08:42,200
set up your workflows,

140
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:45,500
and take complete control
of your development lifecycle.
